flowchart TD
  accTitle: NutsNews backend health report failure and evidence flow
  accDescr {
    The established workflow performs fixed read-only checks. Backend PR 471 stages
    fail-on-critical behavior and one atomic write of bounded audit state, followed by
    five-minute host metrics so Grafana can detect repeated failures or a missed schedule after
    protected deployment and apply.
  }
  A["Scheduled or manual workflow"] --> B["Fixed read-only backend checks"]
  B --> C["Sanitize and classify results"]
  C --> D["Always write report, summary\nand optional email"]
  C --> E{"Critical checks present?"}
  E -->|"Yes"| F["Workflow fails after\nevidence is retained"]
  E -->|"No"| G["Update last successful time"]
  D --> H["Export conclusion, critical count\nand last-success age"]
  F --> H
  G --> H
  H --> H1["Candidate atomically writes one bounded\naudit-state file; not deployed"]
  H1 --> I["Staged five-minute host metrics\nrun/success ages and failure count"]
  I --> J["Grafana: two failures or\nrun evidence older than 30 hours"]
